<title>UK: Hambros details 100 mln rand bond for Bayer Hypo.</title>
<headline>Hambros details 100 mln rand bond for Bayer Hypo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p>The bond was launched on Thursday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     16.0	MATURITY    07.MAY.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.80    PAY DATE    07.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/A+    DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
